\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces The intervention categories on the transmission diagnostic, labelled by category.variant; variant descriptions and the reference configurations C0.1 (standard ODT) and C0.2 (SC-ODT) are in Appendix~B of the main text. Each case: $1024$ paired-seed realisations; effects are median paired same-seed contrasts, ``significant'' meaning the $95\%$ bootstrap confidence interval excludes zero. The size-capped clock \textbf  {C5.2} (the clock-relaxed ODT of the main text), with C0.1 and C0.2, forms the five-way comparison.}}{4}{table.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:s-interventions}{{S1}{4}{The intervention categories on the transmission diagnostic, labelled by category.variant; variant descriptions and the reference configurations C0.1 (standard ODT) and C0.2 (SC-ODT) are in Appendix~B of the main text. Each case: $1024$ paired-seed realisations; effects are median paired same-seed contrasts, ``significant'' meaning the $95\%$ bootstrap confidence interval excludes zero. The size-capped clock \textbf {C5.2} (the clock-relaxed ODT of the main text), with C0.1 and C0.2, forms the five-way comparison}{table.caption.3}{}}
